WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:00.660
Monday.

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.420
Sam gets laid off.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.740
That evening, Sam finds a job that looks like a good fit.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.240
Then one line stops the scroll.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.840
“Comfortable using AI tools.”

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.520
Sam’s never even opened ChatGPT.

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:14.920
Where do you start?

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.940
Sam starts with one free Buggle Learn lesson.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.620
By Friday, Sam tries a first prompt.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.920
“Make my CV summary clearer. Keep it in my voice and stick to what I’ve actually done.”

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.440
Sam checks the draft, changes a line and hits Apply.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.420
Feeling left behind by AI?

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.840
You're not the only one.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.540
And it's not too late.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.600
Buggle Learn.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.320
Short, free AI lessons, for everyone.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.020
Start with the basics today.
